{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0Rpc3RyaWN0JTIwOSUyMCUyODIwMDklMjkv","type":"movie","name":"District 9","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/tuGlQkqLxnodDSk6mp5c2wvxUEd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jhM3wgWUrrOkz9r4xwV5cV5RhI4.jpg","description":"Thirty years ago, aliens arrive on Earth. Not to conquer or give aid, but to find refuge from their dying planet. Separated from humans in a South African area called District 9, the aliens are managed by Multi-National United, which is unconcerned with the aliens' welfare but will do anything to master their advanced technology. When a company field agent contracts a mysterious virus that begins to alter his DNA, there is only one place he can hide: District 9.","releaseInfo":"2009","genres":["Science Fiction","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.5","runtime":"112 min","cast":["Sharlto Copley","Jason Cope","Nathalie Boltt","Sylvaine Strike","Elizabeth Mkandawie","John Sumner","William Allen Young","Nick Blake"],"director":["Neill Blomkamp"],"released":"2009-08-05T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"You are not welcome here.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Sharlto Copley","character":"Wikus van de Merwe","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/em89OJJvBRX7kNJJPASmNKQujsC.jpg"},{"name":"Jason Cope","character":"Christopher Johnson / Grey Bradnam / Trent","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xEqMZClrQQvaygQakUwtS5l7TYH.jpg"},{"name":"Nathalie Boltt","character":"Sarah Livingstone - Sociologist","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mYvZlMSwvv6WDfJHfV6bYm4ddES.jpg"},{"name":"Sylvaine Strike","character":"Dr Katrina McKenzie","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A1O7oEwqy3vebOdnXhyRtKCBeg4.jpg"},{"name":"Elizabeth Mkandawie","character":"Interviewee","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qqiB2LLwNjaEnivKXaRm5opKU4b.jpg"},{"name":"John Sumner","character":"Les Feldman - MIL Engineer","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rsyOO8YniQa0vQKklUYWY